issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108102","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108102.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108102.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-01T23:04:05Z"},"body":"`DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area()` was previously unreliable:\r\n\r\n- It did not account for dock/taskbar on tablets.\r\n- In landscape mode, it failed to account for the cutout area.\r\n- In reverse portrait, it would double-subtract the cutout, resulting in an incorrect safe area.\r\n- If edge-to-edge mode was disabled, it gave more incorrect area, etc.\r\n\r\nThis PR rewrites the safe area logic to address all of these cases. It now reliably returns the correct safe area in my testing with different physical and virtual devices.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105462\r\n\r\nTest Project: [safe_area_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20966505/safe_area_test.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events"